# QualityOS UI

Before editing UI, read `.ui-craft/brief.md`, `lib/design/tokens.css`, and `.cursor/skills/qualityos-design-system/SKILL.md`.

## Stack

Tailwind + shadcn. Use semantic tokens (`bg-card`, `text-brand`, `shadow-card`, `rounded-card`) — never raw hex except `grade.*`.

## Color

60% paper (`background`, `muted`) · 30% ink (`foreground`, `primary`) · 10% ochre (`brand`). One accent per surface. Dark mode uses re-authored tokens in `.dark`.

## Depth

Shadow-first. Cards: `border-0 shadow-card`. Sections: `bg-muted/35`, not `border-y`. Borders only on inputs and table rows.

## Type

`font-display` headlines · `font-sans` body (no tight tracking) · `font-mono` + `section-label` for uppercase labels. `text-balance` headings, `text-pretty` body, `tabular-nums` on numbers.

## Radius

Concentric: inner = outer − padding. Scale: 6px input → 10px badge → 14px modal → 20px card.

## Anti-slop

No icon grids, gradient heroes, colored trend pills, `transition: all`, or default blue/Inter stacks. Sentence case. Real product screenshots over illustrations.

## Polish

`active:scale-[0.96]` on buttons · layered shadows · `prefers-reduced-motion` · focus rings on `--ring` · 40×40px min hit targets.
